      "description": "A Black man is seated at a kitchen table, intensely focused on a laptop screen while eating a banana. His expression suggests deep concentration, as if he is trying not to blink to avoid missing something important on the screen. The scene is framed to emphasize his hyper-focused state, with the laptop in front of him and a glass of orange juice nearby.",
