      "instance_name": "intense_focus",
      "label": "intense focus emotion",
      "description": "The man's facial expression, with narrowed eyes and a fixed gaze, conveys a state of deep concentration and suspense, as if he is trying not to blink to avoid missing something important on the laptop screen. This is reinforced by the context of the text overlay, which references the 'not blink' magic trick trope.",
