      "description": "The meme relies on the stereotype that Black people are hyper-focused or 'always watching,' which is often used in a derogatory way to imply suspicion or exaggerated attentiveness. This stereotype is reinforced by the image of the Black man intensely focused on the laptop, framed as a humorous but racially charged trope.",
