      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_740eeb06",
      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "general internet audience",
      "description": "The meme is designed for a broad online audience familiar with internet humor tropes, particularly the 'not blink or you'll miss the magic trick' meme format. The humor relies on the juxtaposition of mundane activity (eating a banana) with intense focus, which is a common comedic device. The target audience likely includes users of social media platforms who engage with visual memes and understand the cultural reference to magic tricks requiring sustained attention. The racialized element may be overlooked or intentionally used by some viewers as a punchline, but the meme's primary appeal is to those who recognize and enjoy the 'not blinking' trope.",
